{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17219290","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17219290","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721929001:1":{"text":"阿德里安，你知道珍珠为何会不告而别吗？","source_cn":"阿德里安，你知道珍珠为何会不告而别吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F221FAD1C327C07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721929002:1":{"text":"不、不知道……","source_cn":"不、不知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D89F49815DC25CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721929003:1":{"text":"都是因为听腻了你那些苦哈哈的曲子！整天哭哭啼啼的，谁受得了啊？鱼也是会有审美疲劳的！","source_cn":"都是因为听腻了你那些苦哈哈的曲子！整天哭哭啼啼的，谁受...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E8EABB6D0ECA6D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721929004:1":{"text":"是……是这样吗？我还以为她喜欢我的悲伤……","source_cn":"是……是这样吗？我还以为她喜欢我的悲伤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EFEDD495D144186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721929005:1":{"text":"哼，她那是同情你！想要引她出来，必须得来点不一样的！","source_cn":"哼，她那是同情你！想要引她出来，必须得来点不一样的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE714639B592B747E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status